 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? Mostly by sharing as much as feels right. Some couples ask each family to contribute a set amount, others split everything equally. That' a very common first offer. You could say, thank you. We' love to help, but we can't promise. No it' honest. You're welcome to say you' let them know what you can afford. Some couples put money aside for guests who can't attend. That way no one's left out. That makes sense. Good luck with it.",
